msgid "Morocco Riwa Tours — Excursions & circuits authentiques dans le Sahara"
msgstr "Morocco Riwa Tours — Authentic Sahara desert excursions & tours"

msgid ""
"Agence locale à Merzouga : excursions dans le désert, nuits en campement "
"berbère, balades à dos de chameau et circuits sur mesure au Maroc."
msgstr ""
"Local agency based in Merzouga: desert excursions, nights in a Berber camp, "
"camel rides and tailor-made tours in Morocco."

msgid "Accueil"
msgstr "Home"

msgid "Circuits"
msgstr "Tours"

msgid "À propos"
msgstr "About"

msgid "Contact"
msgstr "Contact"

msgid "Langue"
msgstr "Language"

msgid "Réserver"
msgstr "Book now"

msgid ""
"Agence locale basée à Merzouga, aux portes de l'Erg Chebbi. Nous organisons "
"des excursions authentiques dans le Sahara marocain depuis des années, avec "
"des guides berbères passionnés."
msgstr ""
"Local agency based in Merzouga, at the gates of the Erg Chebbi. We have "
"organized authentic excursions in the Moroccan Sahara for years, with "
"passionate Berber guides."

msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "Navigation"

msgid "Nos circuits"
msgstr "Our tours"

msgid "Merzouga, Maroc"
msgstr "Merzouga, Morocco"

msgid "Tous droits réservés."
msgstr "All rights reserved."

msgid "Conçu à Merzouga, porte du Sahara."
msgstr "Designed in Merzouga, gateway to the Sahara."

